msgid "Verify the uploaded file"
msgstr "校验上传的文件"

msgid "The uploaded file is checked against the SHA256SUMS of the VPN module's latest release, downloaded over HTTPS. When that is not possible (offline, an older release), it is installed only if you allow an unverified file: it then runs as root with no check."
msgstr "上传的文件会与通过 HTTPS 下载的 VPN 模块最新发布的 SHA256SUMS 进行校验。如果无法校验（离线、较旧的版本），只有在您允许未校验文件时才会安装：届时它将以 root 身份运行且不经任何检查。"

msgid "Install it even if it cannot be verified"
msgstr "即使无法校验也安装"

msgid "Install only a verified file"
msgstr "仅安装已校验的文件"

msgid "Upload failed: %s"
msgstr "上传失败：%s"

msgid "The VPN module is too old for this panel"
msgstr "VPN 模块版本过旧，此面板无法使用"

msgid "The VPN module is not installed"
msgstr "未安装 VPN 模块"

msgid "This page needs the VPN module with the machine-readable mu300-vpn (module v2 or newer). Updating it keeps the profiles and the settings."
msgstr "此页面需要带机器可读 mu300-vpn 的 VPN 模块（v2 或更新版本）。更新会保留配置文件和设置。"

msgid "The VPN is a module of its own: mu300-vpn with its kill switch and profiles, and one extra per engine (Xray, sing-box, mihomo, dae). It is installed with mu300-extra install vpn."
msgstr "VPN 是一个独立模块：mu300-vpn（含断网保护和配置文件），以及每个引擎一个附加包（Xray、sing-box、mihomo、dae）。使用 mu300-extra install vpn 安装。"

msgid "The download is a few MB for the module and up to tens of MB per engine: on mobile data it counts towards your plan."
msgstr "模块下载约几 MB，每个引擎最多几十 MB：使用移动数据时会计入您的套餐流量。"

msgid "Update the VPN module"
msgstr "更新 VPN 模块"

msgid "Install the VPN module"
msgstr "安装 VPN 模块"

msgid "Upload the file…"
msgstr "上传文件…"

msgid "Offline: upload mu300-linux-vpn-core.tar.gz (or the bundle mu300-linux-vpn.tar.gz) from the release page of the VPN module."
msgstr "离线：从 VPN 模块的发布页面上传 mu300-linux-vpn-core.tar.gz（或合集包 mu300-linux-vpn.tar.gz）。"

msgid "VPN"
msgstr "VPN"

msgid "This is a network or frequency scan: it takes one to three minutes, holds the modem's AT channel all that time, and mobile data may pause meanwhile. It runs in the background; the reply appears here when it is done."
msgstr "这是网络或频点扫描：需要一到三分钟，期间一直占用调制解调器的 AT 通道，移动数据可能暂停。它在后台运行，完成后回复会显示在这里。"

msgid "This changes a network mode, band or cell setting the modem stores: it stays in force after a reboot, and in Android too, where a network that does not match it shows as No Service. The Locks page shows these settings and resets them."
msgstr "这会更改调制解调器保存的网络模式、频段或小区设置：重启后仍然生效，在 Android 中也生效，与之不符的网络会显示为无服务。锁定页面可以查看并重置这些设置。"

msgid "This switches the radio, the data connection or the modem itself: mobile data drops until it is restored, and this page may lose its connection for a while."
msgstr "这会切换射频、数据连接或调制解调器本身：移动数据会中断直到恢复，本页面也可能暂时失去连接。"

msgid "This changes the data profiles (APNs) stored in the modem, which mobile data and Android use."
msgstr "这会更改调制解调器中保存的数据配置（APN），移动数据和 Android 都会使用它们。"

msgid "This changes the SIM's PIN lock or enters a PIN: wrong PINs block the SIM until its PUK is entered."
msgstr "这会更改 SIM 卡的 PIN 锁或输入 PIN：PIN 错误次数过多会锁住 SIM 卡，直到输入 PUK。"

msgid "Basic"
msgstr "基础"

msgid "Registration/signal"
msgstr "注册/信号"

msgid "Bearer"
msgstr "承载"

msgid "Engineering mode"
msgstr "工程模式"

msgid "AT command (↑↓ history, Enter to send)"
msgstr "AT 命令（↑↓ 翻历史，Enter 发送）"

msgid "Send"
msgstr "发送"

msgid "Clear screen"
msgstr "清屏"

msgid "Ready."
msgstr "就绪。"

msgid "Session history (click to reuse)"
msgstr "会话历史（点击复用）"

msgid "Running in the background (at most %d s); the reply appears here when it is done…"
msgstr "正在后台运行（最多 %d 秒）；完成后回复会显示在这里…"

msgid "The modem gave no final answer in time"
msgstr "调制解调器未在规定时间内给出最终回复"

msgid "%d s in the background"
msgstr "后台运行 %d 秒"

msgid "(no output)"
msgstr "(无输出)"

msgid "This command changes the modem's state."
msgstr "此命令会更改调制解调器的状态。"

msgid "Not sent yet: waiting for confirmation"
msgstr "尚未发送：等待确认"

msgid "Send this AT command?"
msgstr "发送此 AT 命令？"

msgid "Send anyway"
msgstr "仍然发送"

msgid "Not sent"
msgstr "未发送"

msgid "Request failed"
msgstr "调用失败"

msgid "(empty)"
msgstr "（空）"

msgid "Passphrase (8 characters or more)"
msgstr "口令（至少 8 个字符）"

msgid "The passphrase again"
msgstr "再次输入口令"

msgid "Download the backup"
msgstr "下载备份"

msgid "Back up the settings"
msgstr "备份设置"

msgid "One file with the hotspot, mobile data and the APN, the network locks, the VPN profiles and settings, SMS forwarding, the LAN address, the host name, the time zone and the SSH keys. It holds passwords: with a passphrase it is encrypted, and only that passphrase opens it again."
msgstr "一个文件包含热点、移动数据和 APN、网络锁定、VPN 配置和设置、短信转发、LAN 地址、主机名、时区和 SSH 密钥。文件中有密码：设置口令后会被加密，只有该口令才能再次打开。"

msgid "Include the login password"
msgstr "包含登录密码"

msgid "Passphrase, if the file is encrypted"
msgstr "口令（如果文件已加密）"

msgid "Show what would change"
msgstr "显示将要更改的内容"

msgid "Restore"
msgstr "恢复"

msgid "The file is larger than 4 MiB"
msgstr "文件大于 4 MiB"

msgid "The settings of the file replace these. The hotspot, mobile data or the LAN may restart, and this page may lose its connection for a moment."
msgstr "文件中的设置将替换当前设置。热点、移动数据或 LAN 可能会重启，本页面可能会暂时断开连接。"

msgid "Restore from a backup"
msgstr "从备份恢复"

msgid "Every value of the file is checked first; one that is refused and nothing is changed. What is the same is left alone, and no VPN profile, subscription or SSH key of this device is removed."
msgstr "文件中的每个值都会先经过检查；只要有一个被拒绝，就不会做任何更改。相同的设置保持不变，本设备的 VPN 配置、订阅和 SSH 密钥都不会被删除。"

msgid "Keep this device's login password"
msgstr "保留本设备的登录密码"

msgid "Take a file of another device model"
msgstr "接受其他设备型号的文件"

msgid "The two passphrases differ"
msgstr "两次输入的口令不同"

msgid "The passphrase needs 8 characters or more"
msgstr "口令至少需要 8 个字符"

msgid "Saved (encrypted)"
msgstr "已保存（已加密）"

msgid "Saved. The file is not encrypted: it holds passwords, keep it safe."
msgstr "已保存。文件未加密：其中含有密码，请妥善保管。"

msgid "Choose a backup file first"
msgstr "请先选择备份文件"

msgid "Restoring…"
msgstr "正在恢复…"

msgid "Restored"
msgstr "已恢复"

msgid "The restore did not finish: see the lines above"
msgstr "恢复未完成：请查看上面的内容"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "加载中…"

msgid "Channel Analysis"
msgstr "信道分析"

msgid "A scan takes the Wi-Fi hotspot off its channel for a moment: connected devices drop, and some (macOS in particular) may not reconnect by themselves. This page scans as soon as it opens and again every few seconds. Reach the panel over USB or another way first if you depend on the hotspot."
msgstr "扫描会让 Wi-Fi 热点短暂离开其信道：已连接的设备会断开，部分设备（尤其是 macOS）可能不会自动重新连接。本页面一打开就会扫描，之后每隔几秒再次扫描。如果您依赖该热点，请先通过 USB 或其他方式访问面板。"

msgid "Scan anyway"
msgstr "仍然扫描"

msgid "Saved"
msgstr "已保存"

msgid "CPU profile unavailable"
msgstr "无法获取 CPU 配置"

msgid "Power saving"
msgstr "省电"

msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "均衡"

msgid "Performance"
msgstr "性能"

msgid "Cores capped at about 60 %% of their maximum (cooler, less power)."
msgstr "核心频率限制在最高频率的约 60%%（更凉爽、更省电）。"

msgid "Schedutil across the full hardware range (the stock behaviour)."
msgstr "在整个硬件频率范围内使用 schedutil（出厂行为）。"

msgid "Every cluster pinned at its hardware maximum."
msgstr "每个集群固定在其硬件最高频率。"

msgid "CPU profile"
msgstr "CPU 配置"

msgid "A profile sets the CPU governor and the per-cluster frequency limits. It stays within the hardware frequency table and never changes the voltage, so it cannot overclock this SoC. The kernel keeps throttling at its thermal limit in every profile."
msgstr "配置会设置 CPU 调速器和每个集群的频率上下限。它只在硬件频率表范围内调整，从不改动电压，因此无法对该 SoC 超频。无论使用哪种配置，内核都会在温度上限处降频。"

msgid "Saved profile: %s"
msgstr "已保存的配置：%s"

msgid "Thermal throttling is active right now: the frequencies below are below the profile ceiling."
msgstr "当前正在进行温度降频：下方的频率低于配置上限。"

msgid "Clusters"
msgstr "集群"

msgid "Cores"
msgstr "核心"

msgid "Governor"
msgstr "调速器"

msgid "Now"
msgstr "当前"

msgid "Min"
msgstr "最低"

msgid "Max"
msgstr "最高"

msgid "Hardware max"
msgstr "硬件最高"

msgid "Frequencies in MHz."
msgstr "频率单位为 MHz。"

msgid "Highlighted cores are online. A core taken offline stays offline, also after a reboot, until it is brought back. CPU0 always stays online."
msgstr "高亮的核心处于在线状态。被关闭的核心会保持离线，重启后也是如此，直到重新开启。CPU0 始终保持在线。"

msgid "Low latency: on"
msgstr "低延迟：开"

msgid "Low latency: off"
msgstr "低延迟：关"

msgid "Low latency keeps CPU0 out of its idle states, as ZTE's U30 Air firmware does: Wi-Fi delays are much shorter, and the device draws more power. Off by default."
msgstr "低延迟模式让 CPU0 不进入空闲状态，与 ZTE U30 Air 原厂固件相同：Wi-Fi 延迟大幅缩短，设备耗电增加。默认关闭。"

msgid "Thermal"
msgstr "温控"

msgid "The kernel's thermal zones, read only. A zone with trip points throttles the cooling devices bound to it at its passive trip; a cooling state of 0 is no throttling."
msgstr "内核的温区，只读。带有触发点的温区会在其被动触发点限制与之绑定的冷却设备；冷却状态 0 表示未限频。"

msgid "Zone"
msgstr "温区"

msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "温度"

msgid "Trip points"
msgstr "触发点"

msgid "Cooling devices"
msgstr "冷却设备"

msgid "Stress test started"
msgstr "压力测试已开始"

msgid "Saved: it takes effect at the next reboot"
msgstr "已保存：将在下次重启时生效"

msgid "CPU voltage offset (EXPERIMENTAL)"
msgstr "CPU 电压偏移（实验性）"

msgid "Experimental: changing the CPU voltage can make the device unstable, corrupt your data and permanently damage your device. Use it entirely at your own risk."
msgstr "实验性功能：修改 CPU 电压可能导致设备不稳定、损坏您的数据，并可能对您的设备造成永久性损坏。风险完全由您自行承担。"

msgid "CPU voltage offset unavailable"
msgstr "CPU 电压偏移不可用"

msgid "Not available with this kernel (a mainline kernel of this release or later has it)."
msgstr "此内核不支持（本版本或更新版本的主线内核支持）。"

msgid "Off: the stock voltages"
msgstr "关闭：出厂电压"

msgid "Changes at the next reboot"
msgstr "将在下次重启时更改"

msgid "Trial boot: kept once this boot has been up 10 minutes"
msgstr "试用启动：本次启动运行满 10 分钟后保留"

msgid "Kept: this offset passed its trial boot"
msgstr "已保留：此偏移已通过试用启动"

msgid "a boot with it ended without a clean shutdown"
msgstr "使用该偏移的一次启动未正常关机就结束了"

msgid "its trial boot ended before 10 minutes"
msgstr "其试用启动在 10 分钟内结束"

msgid "invalid value"
msgstr "无效值"

msgid "unknown SoC firmware"
msgstr "未知的 SoC 固件"

msgid "refused by the kernel"
msgstr "被内核拒绝"

msgid "the kernel could not start CPU scaling with it"
msgstr "内核无法以此偏移启动 CPU 调频"

msgid "Offsets in µV for the three CPU domains (cores 0-3, 4-6 and 7), in whole steps. A new offset takes effect at the next reboot, as a trial: it is kept once that boot has been up 10 minutes, and dropped (back to 0) if a boot with it ends in a crash, a watchdog reset or a power cut."
msgstr "三个 CPU 电压域（核心 0-3、4-6 和 7）的偏移，单位 µV，须为整数步长。新的偏移在下次重启时以试用方式生效：该次启动运行满 10 分钟后保留；若使用它的启动以崩溃、看门狗复位或断电结束，则丢弃（恢复为 0）。"

msgid "Running now (µV)"
msgstr "当前运行（µV）"

msgid "Saved for the next boot (µV)"
msgstr "已保存，下次启动生效（µV）"

msgid "State"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Taken back automatically: %s µV (%s)"
msgstr "已自动撤销：%s µV（%s）"

msgid "The SoC firmware of this device is not one whose voltage encoding is known: only the stock voltages are possible."
msgstr "此设备的 SoC 固件不在已知电压编码的版本之列：只能使用出厂电压。"

msgid "Domain"
msgstr "电压域"

msgid "Offset now (µV)"
msgstr "当前偏移（µV）"

msgid "Highest step"
msgstr "最高档位"

msgid "New offset (µV)"
msgstr "新偏移（µV）"

msgid "Limits: %d to %d µV, in steps of %d µV."
msgstr "范围：%d 至 %d µV，步长 %d µV。"

msgid "Save for the next boot"
msgstr "保存，下次启动生效"

msgid "Each offset must be a multiple of %d µV between %d and %d."
msgstr "每个偏移必须是 %d µV 的整数倍，且介于 %d 和 %d 之间。"

msgid "Type %s to confirm."
msgstr "输入 %s 以确认。"

msgid "Back to the stock voltages"
msgstr "恢复出厂电压"

msgid "Type %s to confirm:"
msgstr "输入 %s 以确认："

msgid "Run a 10-minute CPU stress test"
msgstr "运行 10 分钟 CPU 压力测试"

msgid "Test a new offset under load during its trial boot. The device may crash if the voltage is too low; the next boot then runs at the stock voltages."
msgstr "在试用启动期间于负载下测试新的偏移。电压过低时设备可能崩溃；之后的下次启动将使用出厂电压。"

msgid "A stress test is running."
msgstr "压力测试正在运行。"

msgid "USB role"
msgstr "USB 角色"

msgid "Current role"
msgstr "当前角色"

msgid "Switch USB role"
msgstr "切换 USB 角色"

msgid "Device mode"
msgstr "设备模式"

msgid "Host mode"
msgstr "主机模式"

msgid "Enable host mode at boot"
msgstr "开机自动启用主机模式"

msgid "Apply role"
msgstr "应用角色"

msgid "Host mode disconnects USB networking and serial on this port. F50 has no battery; management may be lost and a USB adapter usually needs a powered hub."
msgstr "主机模式会断开本端口的 USB 网络与串口。F50 没有电池；切换后可能失去管理连接，外接 USB 网卡通常需要自供电 Hub。"

msgid "USB network mode"
msgstr "USB 网络模式"

msgid "Network protocol"
msgstr "网络协议"

msgid "Apply duration"
msgstr "生效期限"

msgid "Next reboot only"
msgstr "仅下次重启"

msgid "Permanent"
msgstr "永久生效"

msgid "Enable selected protocol"
msgstr "启用所选协议"

msgid "Save; apply after reboot"
msgstr "保存，重启后生效"

msgid "NCM is the default. Windows does not natively support ECM; RNDIS changes enumeration. With Enable selected protocol off, only your choice is saved. Next reboot only applies once, then returns to NCM."
msgstr "NCM 为默认模式。Windows 不原生支持 ECM；RNDIS 会改变枚举方式。关闭“启用所选协议”时仅保存选择；选择“仅下次重启”则成功应用一次后恢复默认 NCM。"

msgid "USB adapters"
msgstr "USB 网卡"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

msgid "Available only in host mode. Refresh brings discovered USB adapters up; adding to LAN saves the bridge and reloads networking."
msgstr "仅主机模式可用。刷新时会尝试启用发现的 USB 网卡；添加到 LAN 后将保存到网桥并重新加载网络。"

msgid "Recent modem operations"
msgstr "最近的调制解调器操作"

msgid "Show"
msgstr "显示"

msgid "The control panel's recent calls, of this boot and the one before: when, which page call or AT command, how long it took and how it ended (ok, error, busy, killed). No values, replies or messages are kept. Useful when the panel was stuck."
msgstr "控制面板在本次及上一次启动中的最近调用：时间、哪个页面调用或 AT 命令、耗时以及结果（成功、错误、忙、被终止）。不保存任何数值、回复或短信。面板卡住时可用于排查。"

msgid "Unavailable"
msgstr "不可用"

msgid "USB network mode is unavailable in host mode; host auto-start also disables USB network auto-start."
msgstr "主机模式下不可选择 USB 网络模式；主机开机自启会自动关闭 USB 网络开机自启。"

msgid "Host mode immediately disconnects USB management. F50 has no battery and peripherals may need external power; make sure another management path exists."
msgstr "切换主机模式会立即断开 USB 管理连接。F50 没有电池，外设可能需要自供电；请确认有其他管理途径。"

msgid "USB networking and serial will re-enumerate in device mode."
msgstr "切回设备模式后 USB 网络和串口会重新枚举。"

msgid "Switch USB role?"
msgstr "确认切换 USB 角色？"

msgid "Apply"
msgstr "应用"

msgid "Switching USB role…"
msgstr "正在切换 USB 角色…"

msgid "Switch failed: %s"
msgstr "切换失败：%s"

msgid "Management connection lost; reconnect to confirm the USB role."
msgstr "管理连接已中断；请重新连接后确认 USB 角色。"

